 639→### Multiply Blend Mode Color Mixing [[Ep5, 102:24](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qPwiuQUT-N4&t=6144s)]
 640→```vex
 641→int pts[];
 642→int pt;
 643→vector col, pos;
 644→float d;
 645→
 646→pts = nearpoints(1, @P, ch("radius"));
